    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="298707ba-3961-5a68-a0fa-1dc3c57c1047" activityNameId="2f5a193a-ec7f-58b8-953b-90c8e0f71935" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biomethane, burned in cogen 50kWth</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biomethane, burned in cogen 50kWth
Inventory for 1 MJ biomethane, burned in a cogeneration plant with a capacity of 50 kWth. This inventory reflects the unallocated process of burning biomethane in a cogen unit with all necessary inputs and emissions. Efficiency of the cogen unit as well allocation is not yet considered;
Synonyms: Biogas, aufbereitet, in BHkWth 50kWth; 
UUID: cc6a9c60-8635-3bcc-8dfa-eeaa73d1ce3a
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (cogeneration plant), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: extrapolated from natural gas, burned in cogen 50kWth
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cc6a9c60-8635-3bcc-8dfa-eeaa73d1ce3a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
